e": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le09ob04re1img01.png"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Past Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<br>You use the Simple Past tense to talk about a finished event or a specific time in the past.<br>  <br> You can form the regular form of the Simple Past tense by adding  <span class=\"strong\">ed</span>,  <span class=\"strong\">-ied</span> to the verb.<br>  <br>Some verbs are irregular. Their Past Simple form doesn't end in -ed or -ied, like  <span class=\"italic\">became</span> or <span class=\"italic\">was</span> or <span class=\"italic\">won</span>.<br>  <br>You pronounce / t / after voiceless sounds: / p /, / k /, / s /, / f / and voiceless / th / sound.<br>  <br>You  pronounce / d / after voiced sounds: / b / , / g /, / v /, / z/ , / m/ , /n /, / l /, / r / , voiced / th / sound and all vowels. <br>   <br>You  pronounce / id / after / d / and / t / sounds.<br>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Tense with <span class=\\\"strong\\\">-ed</span> ending\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"work \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"worked \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"smile \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"smiled \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"finish \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"finished \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"like\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"liked\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Tense with <span class=\\\"strong\\\">-ied</span> ending\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"marry\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"married\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"reply \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"replied\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"try\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tried\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" fry \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fried\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"apply\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"applied\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "geometric"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "lines and angles "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I bought pants with geometric patterns."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob04aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you write about village markets."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fiber"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a thin thread of natural or artificial material that can be used to make cloth and paper "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The fiber is twisted to make the basket."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob04aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "woven"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something made by crossing threads or other long pieces of material over and under each other "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The container was woven and had a design of butterflies in the center."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob04aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "carving"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the art of cutting designs into wood "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I wanted to buy a wooden carving."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "handcraft "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make something by using your hands "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The handcrafts at the village market were so well-made."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob04aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to ship "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to send something to a customer"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The store told me they would ship the carving to Cambridge."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob04aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to spot "}, {"type": "definition", "conten